    const password = generatePassword();
    const ip = sandboxIp(vmid);
    // Real provisioning writes `step()` between genuinely slow Proxmox
    // operations, which is what <Provisioning/> (components/nx/Provisioning.tsx)
    // animates through. With nothing real to wait for, this whole function
    // used to return in one DB write — so fast that a human watching it never
    // saw more than a flash of the spinner before the "server is live" screen,
    // which is a real gap for anyone using sandbox mode to see or record the
    // deploy flow (lib/provisioning-step.ts's own doc comment already flags
    // this: "SANDBOX mode, which completes before any step is ever recorded").
    // These are the exact same label substrings <Provisioning/>'s STAGES array
