  // below reuses `serverRootPassword(server)` instead of minting a fresh one
  // whenever `server.vmid` is already set — that reuse exists for a RETRY
  // (cloud-init's password module is once-per-instance, so a retry must not
  // overwrite Server.rootPasswordEnc with a value the already-booted guest
